                  "source": "commons-categories",
                  "hidden": ""
                },
                "ImageDescription": {
                  "value": "Short explanation of the image content: The scene is considered  intimate in a private space. On the left we see a black garment whose transparent section is partly covered by a  red garment exposing most of the leg including the buttocks while hiding the more intimate parts. On the right the black garment has the same fiber density from the toes to the waistband. In addition the part in the crotch is less stretched and also denser making covering by another garment optional.\n<p>Model on the left is wearing a thong bodysuit with long sleeves and turtle neck made in Austria by “Wolford” of the “Santa Barbara” series. Product name is “String Body”. Number “70958”. Color “\"pupur red / black, 9744\". Size “S”. Sold in Vienna, late in the year of 2002 for 179 Euro.\nThe mock hold up tights made in Europe are of the “Fiore” brand. Model “Sense”. Size “M”. Fiber wight advertised as 60 denier. Sold in Germany for 5 Euro in the year of 2024. \n</p><p>Model on the right is wearing a long sleeve shirt with horseshoe neckline made in Austria by Wolford of the “Santa Barbara” series. Product name is “Sweater”. Number “50948”. Size “XS”\n</p>\nThe seamless tights made in Europe are of the “Filodoro” brand. model “Velluto”. Size “M”. Fiber wight advertised as 60 denier. Sold in Germany via Amazon from Italy for about 8 to 12 Euros.",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
                },
